      "translit": "Qālū dʿu lanā rabbaka yubayyin lanā mā hiya qāla innahū yaqūlu innahā baqaratun lā fāriḍun walā bikrun ʿawānu bayna dhālika fafʿalū mā tuʾmarūn",
